# GraphTable

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphTable } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphTable
  title="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `headers` | `string[]` | `—` | — |
| `rows` | `Cell[][]` | `—` | — |
| `footer?` | `Cell[]` | `—` | — |
| `align?` | `('left' | 'right')[]` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `Cell`
- `GraphTableProps`
